OL,3,ABodies of two hikers missing for
OL,4,Adecades found after Swiss glacier melts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bodies of two Belgian men who went
OL,7,Fmissing in the Swiss Alps in 1992 have
OL,8,Fbeen discovered after being exposed by
OL,9,Fthe melting of a glacier, police have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FA hiker discovered the bodies on 26
OL,13,FJuly on the Trift Glacier, south of the
OL,14,FSwiss city of Lucerne, officials said.
OL,16,FDNA analysis later confirmed them to be
OL,17,Fthose of two mountaineers who went
OL,18,Fmissing 34 years ago near the Weissmies
OL,19,Fmountain, police said. They were aged
OL,20,F39 and 41 at the time of their
OL,21,Fdisappearance.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
