OL,3,ABodies of two hikers missing for
OL,4,Adecades found after Swiss glacier melts
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany scientists attribute a rapid
OL,7,Fretreat in Switzerland's glaciers -
OL,8,Fwhich shrunk by a quarter in the decade
OL,9,Fto 2025, according to Glacier
OL,10,FMonitoring in Switzerland (Glamos) - to
OL,11,Fclimate change.
